    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="e99f1017-742e-5d46-95a3-b8d07ad85a14" activityNameId="aa3d0462-339c-569b-a400-ba724344a37d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wooden board manufacturing plant, organic bonded boards</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wooden board manufacturing plant, organic bonded boards
The service life is assumed to be 50 years. Thus the life time output is 30'000'000 m3 board. This data must only be used to consider the infrastructure needed for wood board production if this is not relevant.;
Synonyms: Spanplattenwerk, MDF-Werk, OSB-Werk, Sperrholzwerk, Faserplattenwerk; 
UUID: 90039d7f-2872-3c9f-b721-544860a8d3fa
The land area and the material and their transports needed for building and disposal of a plant for organic bonded wooden boards with a yearly output of 600"000 m3 is included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Relates to a medium to large production plant for wooden boards using one or several Conti-presses.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: estimation 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_90039d7f-2872-3c9f-b721-544860a8d3fa.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
